{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-04-13 13:24:00', 'title': 'TOLEDO EDISON PARTNERS WITH OTTAWA NATIONAL WILDLIFE REFUGE COMPLEX TO PROTECT NESTING BIRDS', 'text': 'TOLEDO, OHIO, APRIL 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AS PART OF ITS ONGOING EFFORTS TO PROTECT NESTING BIRDS, TOLEDO EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS PARTNERED WITH THE U.S. FISH AND WILDLIFE SERVICE TO DONATE AND INSTALL A 55-FOOT WOODEN POLE WITH A NESTING PLATFORM ATOP AT THE CEDAR POINT NATIONAL WILDLIFE REFUGE, WHICH IS PART OF THE OTTAWA NATIONAL WILDLIFE REFUGE COMPLEX. THIS PROACTIVE WORK WILL PROVIDE A SAFE NESTING LOCATION FOR THE GROWING OSPREY POPULATION AND PROMOTE OSPREY CONSERVATION EFFORTS IN THE AREA.'}